{"page":351,"verses":[{"verse_key":"24:11","surah":24,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ جَآءُو بِٱلْإِفْكِ عُصْبَةٌ مِّنكُمْ ۚ لَا تَحْسَبُوهُ شَرًّا لَّكُم ۖ بَلْ هُوَ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ ۚ لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِئٍ مِّنْهُم مَّا ٱكْتَسَبَ مِنَ ٱلْإِثْمِ ۚ وَٱلَّذِى تَوَلَّىٰ كِبْرَهُۥ مِنْهُمْ لَهُۥ عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It was a group from among you that concocted the lie––do not consider it a bad thing for you [people]; it was a good thing––and every one of them will be charged with the sin he has earned. He who took the greatest part in it will have a painful punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَآءُو","en_gloss":"brought","transliteration":"jāū","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱلْإِفْكِ","en_gloss":"the lie","transliteration":"bil-if'ki","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عُصْبَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) a group","transliteration":"ʿuṣ'batun","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(Do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَحْسَبُوهُ","en_gloss":"think it","transliteration":"taḥsabūhu","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شَرًّۭا","en_gloss":"bad","transliteration":"sharran","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَّكُم ۖ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بَلْ","en_gloss":"nay","transliteration":"bal","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) good","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لَّكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"24:11"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لِكُلِّ","en_gloss":"For every","transliteration":"likulli","ver